maintainer, and the request will be honoured.

Fonts in web/fonts belong to their respective authors and are under their own terms. The soundtrack
recordings in web/data/music were made by a fan (Zacha Pedro) from the game's music and are likewise not
covered by this license.


2. The web port: MIT License (with attribution)
-----------------------------------------------

The new work in this project is the JavaScript reimplementation of the game (web/js), the web page and its
additions (menu bar, touch controls, display scaling, saving and other features not in the original), the
tools in re/tools, and the reverse-engineering notes and annotations in re/. It is licensed as follows, to
the extent of the author's rights in it. It does not cover any of the original game's material in part 1.

